<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The single-task results and the reward scales for Atari (without shared structure) are shown in <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table A.11 ‣ A.3 Single-task runs ‣ Appendix A Tabular data &amp; additional results ‣ ARROW: Augmented Replay for RObust World models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab. A.11</span></a>.
The single-task results for CoinRun (shared structure) are shown in <a href="#A1.T12" title="Table A.12 ‣ A.3 Single-task runs ‣ Appendix A Tabular data &amp; additional results ‣ ARROW: Augmented Replay for RObust World models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab. A.12</span></a>.</p>
</div>
